1nz4|n|The peel or skin. ; A medicine in the form of a little ball, or small round mass, to be swallowed whole. ; Figuratively, something offensive or nauseous which must be accepted or endured.	a:29yn,93,3;1bcj,85,1;zqd,60,5~zqd,60,5;29yn,93,3;1bcj,85,1	n:1bcj,95,2;zqd,47,2~1bcj,95,2;zqd,47,2
