1nzq|n|Anything used to support the head of a person when reposing; especially, a sack or case filled with feathers, down, hair, or other soft material. ; A piece of metal or wood, forming a support to equalize pressure; a brass; a pillow block. ; A block under the inner end of a bowsprit. ; A kind of plain, coarse fustian.	N:8xn,107,3~8xn,107,3
